{"availability":"available","full":"iTanmayTrivedi/ServiceScheduleJapan","name":"ServiceScheduleJapan","description":"Japanese-first bilingual appointment platform (EN/JA) studying the UX patterns that distinguish Japanese service businesses — salons, clinics, restaurants. 3 roles · 7 PostgreSQL tables with 100% RLS · AI-assisted booking · dark mode · demo mode for instant role evaluation. 「丁寧に作る」— Built with care.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-22T03:33:47Z","updated":"2026-10-01T10:14:45Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bookflow.tanmaytrivedi.dev","topics":["ai-assistants","appointment-scheduling","booking-system","dark-mode","edge-functions","framer-motion","groq-integration","i18n","japan","japanese","postgresql","rbac","react","react-router","row-level-security","supabase","tailwindcss","tanstack-query","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://bookflow.tanmaytrivedi.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.198Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.198Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.198Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.198Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["「一期一会」 — Ichi-go ichi-e — Treasure every encounter, for it will never recur. A full-stack appointment platform built to study the UX patterns that distinguish Japanese service businesses — salons, clinics, restaurants — from Western booking apps. Designed with the quiet precision Japanese users expect: explicit confirmation, respectful rescheduling windows, dense-but-calm information design, and a frictionless demo mode for recruiter evaluation.","EN: This project was built to study the UX patterns that distinguish Japanese service businesses — salons, clinics, restaurants — from Western booking platforms. Reliability signals, polite confirmation flows, bilingual interfaces, and respectful rescheduling windows matter deeply to Japanese users. Understanding these patterns is essential for building products that resonate in the Japanese market.","日本語: このプロジェクトは、日本のサービス業（サロン、クリニック、飲食店など）の予約UXが西洋の予約アプリとどう異なるかを研究するために構築しました。信頼性のシグナル、丁寧な確認フロー、バイリンガルUI、礼儀正しいリスケジュール期限など、日本のユーザーが大切にする要素をプロダクトに落とし込むために不可欠な学びを得ました。"],"features":["📅 Full appointment lifecycle — pending → confirmed → completed / cancelled","👤 Role-based access — Customer / Staff / Admin with distinct dashboards","🤖 AI assistant — smart slot recommendation via Gemini through Edge Functions","🌐 Bilingual UI — Japanese / English toggle with 238 parallel translation keys","🔐 Email + Google OAuth authentication with session management"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iTanmayTrivedi/ServiceScheduleJapan/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cb2b8137ce1a7fb714bb8e79554a501031e5e37a2fd874c8fd44c2d6cc940f51","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.396Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.396Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"「一期一会」 — Ichi-go ichi-e — Treasure every encounter, for it will never recur. A full-stack appointment platform built to study the UX patterns that distinguish Japanese service businesses — salons, clinics, restaurants — from Western booking apps. Designed with the quiet precision Japanese users expect: explicit confirmation, respectful rescheduling windows, dense-but-calm information design, and a frictionless demo mode for recruiter evaluation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iTanmayTrivedi/ServiceScheduleJapan/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cb2b8137ce1a7fb714bb8e79554a501031e5e37a2fd874c8fd44c2d6cc940f51","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iTanmayTrivedi/ServiceScheduleJapan/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.397Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T10:14:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/iTanmayTrivedi/ServiceScheduleJapan/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.398Z","hash":"cb2b8137ce1a7